  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss5:4.2.17": "Sp 1.303: <i lang='pi' translate='no'>Saha ārakkhenāti sārakkhā</i>, “<i lang='pi' translate='no'>Sārakkha</i> means having protection.” Sp-ṭ 1.303: <i lang='pi' translate='no'>Sasāmikā sārakkhā</i>, “<i lang='pi' translate='no'>Sārakkhā</i> means having a husband.” But it clearly does not mean marriage in a modern sense. ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss5:4.2.18": "",
