  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss5:4.4.33": "For an explanation of these sectional summaries, see Appendix of Specialized Vocabulary under <i lang='pi' translate='no'>khaṇḍa</i> and <i lang='pi' translate='no'>cakka</i>. ",
